usage: codec_calibrate.py [-h] --nativeweave NATIVEWEAVE --policy POLICY
                          --policy-sha256 POLICY_SHA256 --build BUILD
                          --build-sha256 BUILD_SHA256 --corpus CORPUS
                          --corpus-sha256 CORPUS_SHA256
                          [--variant {before,after,direct}] --output OUTPUT

Serial codec calibration: the existing v3 loop with explicit producer inputs.
The committed codec driver owns timing, correctness, affinity and cleanup. Run
only under the integration owner's exclusive measurement control.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --nativeweave NATIVEWEAVE
  --policy POLICY
  --policy-sha256 POLICY_SHA256
  --build BUILD         Actual prepared codec manifest.json
  --build-sha256 BUILD_SHA256
  --corpus CORPUS
  --corpus-sha256 CORPUS_SHA256
                        SHA-256 of corpus/manifest.json
  --variant {before,after,direct}
  --output OUTPUT       New calibration directory; never reused
